No can do.


: How do I get filespec expansion to recurse directories? 

find


: How do I get the shell to perform simple numeric calculations? ...string
: manipulation (concatenation, reduction ala DCL)? ...conversion from
: binary datatypes to string datatypes (ala F$CVxI())?

: How do I get the shell to "export" variables to "outer" levels (ala DCL
