: global symbols)?

Good point.  How do you do it in DCL?

$ show sym test
%DCL-W-UNDSYM, undefined symbol - check validity and spelling
$ test:==this is a test
$ show sym test
  TEST == "THIS IS A TEST"
$ spawn
%DCL-S-SPAWNED, process FULLER_1 spawned
%DCL-S-ATTACHED, terminal now attached to process FULLER_1
$ show sym test
  TEST == "THIS IS A TEST"
$ test:==this is a new test
