Try "Bob Koehler's fevered imagination".

There were no machine instructions that made any assumptions about the
stack pointer.

Nor were there any system calls (JSYS or UUO) on any operating system
which made any such assumptions.

The only thing that assumed AC 17 were some macros in the MACSYM package,
usage of which was totally optional (and was specific to TOPS-20).

