there should have been a DEC supported version. An unsupported
DCLCOMP:LETE.MAR has circulated for years. VMS's CLD (command language
definition) files can be used by a COMND implementation to provide
lists of options on input of "?" and command completion.

>GTJFN/GNJFN/JFNS, TTLNK, ? (or /? if you want to be Microsoftish), and
