Jan Vorbrueggen wrote:
> 
> Edward Franks <fortrandragon@hotmail.com> writes:
> 
> >       Because the 'us vs them' + 'chip on shoulder' attitude is prevalent
> > in all human organizations?  Also, if DEC's senior management had
> > decided that VMS was to be _the_ DEC OS going forward then the VMS group
> > became the golden children of the company and could do no wrong.
> 
> Then senior management was not doing its job properly. But what else is
> new.
> 
