Tim,

The RQDX3 only supports fixed disks (RD5x) and floppy drives.  There was
a separate controller for TK50 tape drives (M7546 for QBUS or M7547 for
UNIBUS). TK70 drives also use a different controller from the TK50
(M7559 for QBUS only).

