Well, I found a bug in the broken prefetch instruction buffer.  I fixed
a bug by adding vax_Read to force page fault.  No more machine check 
errors!  Debug.log showed that it transferred its control to scheduler 
and started to execute something in user mode at loc 1022.  Also, it 
generated some page faults for refilling pages.  However, I have another 
problem with loc 104A.  Something changed CALLS to MNEGD that cause 
endless loop with reserved operand fault.  I am figuring that out.

