and market share during the merger announcement it is now a level 10
problem.  They sent the ISV community a clear negative message.  Unix market
share was flagged 18 months ago by Compaq senior management as a strategic
problem.

Compaq has 3 ways I can see to become a credible Unix player now that they
have trashed the reputation of Tru64 as a viable commercial product...

1) Merge

