AT.T0 - is the indirect command processor (it handles @ prefix - hence
AT) running on device tt0 - i.e. the console.
It has tried to set-up to write output to an open file (file handle
#1) and the file isn't open!
Possibly a bug in the sysgen process or perhaps it does not have write
access to whatever t is trying to write to (presumably the sysgen
answers file).
